# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (production mode) so a manual
# rebuild can't silently fall back to the localhost default in client.ts.
# This is a public API origin, not a secret.
#
# TEMPORARY: pointing at the Railway-issued domain, not api.evorove.com.
# The custom domain's DNS was never actually finished -- Railway is still
# waiting on a CNAME record ("api" -> db5e8wl7.up.railway.app) that was
# never created (or was removed) at the DNS provider, so api.evorove.com
# doesn't resolve for anyone. Once that CNAME is added and Railway shows
# the domain as verified, switch this back to https://api.evorove.com.
VITE_API_BASE=https://ai-business-process-engine-production.up.railway.app
